WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.310
Chara-su!

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.140
Hi! Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.920
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.700
The next thirty minutes is chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.260
We hope you totally enjoy them!

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.810
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.160
Unlock!

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.700
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.010
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.880
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.730
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.610
you're like a dream.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.460
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.350
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.190
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.990
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:40.790
Whenever I start something new

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.500
I get really excited,

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.170
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:51.310
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:58.950
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:02.740
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.870
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:11.490
It's party time!

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:15.240
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.980
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:23.180
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.390
It's party time!

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.100
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.610
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:38.240
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.030
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.510
Hiyas, my little Eggs!

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.250
Which anime's up first on Shugo Chara Party?

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.080
The one starring the Guardian Characters!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.000
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.970
Which Guardian Characters will be featured today?

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.480
Let's find out!

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:04.130
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.470
"Change!"

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.150
Weather sure is nice today.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.030
Yeah.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.530
And there's nothing like an afternoon nap.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:18.080
I'm plum tuckered out.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.070
Huh?

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.930
Look who's coming this way.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.820
The sunny skies, the wind at my back!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.040
Ah, it feels heavenly to soar so gallantly!

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.560
Watch out!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.630
Are you two okay?

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.390
Golly, that hurt.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:39.280
Watch where you are going, knave!

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.610
Th-There are two of me!

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:45.640
How curious! Why is there another me?

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.660
Oh no! The two of them have...

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.430
...switched bodies!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.880
This is quite disconcerting!

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.410
Please return my body to me!

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.240
I should say the same!

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:59.670
At least stop making me look so effeminate!

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.400
What are we going to do, Miki?

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.700
Hmm... Maybe this?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.290
That hurt, you jerk!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.310
What are you doing?

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:14.320
Huh?

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.090
Now Ran and Su have switched?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.310
Ran - Kiseki - Su

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.740
I knew it! Bumping your heads together made you switch bodies.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:32.310
Body
Mind

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.780
Ran - Su - Kiseki

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:32.310
Su - Ran - Kiseki

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.370
Oh!

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.720
But why did you use me as a guinea pig?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:30.190
If me and Kiseki-san had bumped into each other again, we'd be back to normal!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.010
Anyway, let's hurry and switch back!

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.520
What insolence! Why did you dodge?

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.240
Because it's gonna hurt!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.790
It's a momentary bit of suffering! Deal with it!

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:45.840
You know, you might return to normal, but I'd be stuck in Su's body!

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.460
I'm gonna bump into myself!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.190
I'm the only one who's bumped into people twice!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.040
I'm going to bump into myself first!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.680
You cannot escape, commoner!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.690
Go me!

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.550
Please give me back my body!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.570
Come on, guys, calm down!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.060
Wait!

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.090
Oww...

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.970
I'm back to normal!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:15.940
Me, too!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.250
As am I!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.030
See you again!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.460
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:34.900
The first Character we'll introduce is... Kiseki!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:41.260
Kiseki belongs to Tadase, the Guardian's King's Chair.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.730
His personality is the complete opposite of the bashful Tadase-kun.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.890
He both looks and acts like a king!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.360
He's especially good at giving orders!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:07.180
Continuing on, the second Character is... Pepe!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:12.400
Her rabbit-eared hat and pacifier are so lovely!

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:17.230
Babyish Pepe is Yaya's Guardian Character, the Guardian's Ace's Chair.

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:21.240
She's Yaya-chan's would-be self-dechu!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:33.000
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.970
Look forward to it!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:41.000
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.450
Today we'll be playing a "touch and answer" character quiz!

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.990
There are a bunch of Shugo Chara figures inside this box.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:52.710
Try to pick out the correct Character to solve the quiz, 'kay?

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.320
Okay, here's the question:

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.620
Who was Amu's first Guardian Character to be born?

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.350
You should know this one!

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:03.280
That's my girls!

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.670
No peeking!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.360
You have to do it by touch.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:10.280
Which one is which?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.920
This could be amazing!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.140
Hurry, hurry!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.640
Keep at it, Clover!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.720
Time's almost up!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.410
Time's up!

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.000
Okay, girls, show us your answers!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.770
Ready, set...

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.440
Ta-da!

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.850
Amu's first Guardian Character was...

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:35.970
Ran!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.520
Heart and Spade were right!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.540
Today's winners are Amulet Heart and Amulet Spade!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.480
Do your best next week!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:53.100
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.470
"Shugo Bomber! Part 1!"

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.700
The X Eggs just won't stop coming.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.180
But Amu-chan and the others are working so hard.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:06.100
We've really got to step up our game.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.250
Oh, I see, yes...

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.820
In that case, I have an idea.

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:16.830
Egg Rangers - Shugo Bomber!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:22.020
The warrior trio formed to combat the X Egg Empire!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:23.840
Huh?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.580
Where are we?

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.780
You did well to find this place.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.520
What the heck's with the sunglasses?

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.680
Hey, can you tell us where we are?

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.880
This is Shugo Base!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.350
It is a secret base of operations, constructed through the power of science!

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.030
The power of science?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.090
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:45.020
The time we've all been dreading is upon us!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:48.380
The evil X Egg Empire has awakened from its long slumber,

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.860
and has set into action its plans for world domination!

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.680
You three are the chosen ones!

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:58.870
From this day forth you will be known as the Shugo Bomber warriors!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.740
Shugo Bomber?

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:06.400
I believe it would be wise for us to power-up in our fight against the X Eggs,

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.570
so I studied many different things.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.570
Hero Encyclopedia - All about Heros

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.370
Right... We appreciate the effort, but...

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.510
Su, this is a little...

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.580
I am not Su!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.360
I am The Commissioner!

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.830
Since Ran is red, she's the hot-blooded leader!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.020
The Flame Warrior, Shugo Fire!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.600
Give us a shout!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.120
Since Miki is blue, she's the cool second-in-command!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.190
The Water Warrior, Shugo Aqua!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.180
She's cool, but kind!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.190
But cool!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.110
Which one is it?

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:40.950
And since Dia is yellow, she's the Lightning Warrior, Shugo Thunder!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:45.080
Um, I apologize, but yellow usually serves as comic relief.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.290
Can you handle being, like, the gluttonous member?

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.750
You mean I have to eat all the time?

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.810
Exactly! I'll even make you some yummy curry.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.380
Don't do it, Dia.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.500
Don't let her drag you into her little-

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.240
Shugo Thunder's on the scene!

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.390
She's into it...

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.370
And with that, the warriors of justice are born!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:05.320
The fate of the world rests on your shoulders!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:07.290
Fight, Shugo Bomber!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.560
Go, Shugo Bomber!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.900
To Be Continued

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:13.610
There's gonna be more?!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.270
Until we meet again!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.030
See you next time!

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:20.780
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.410
Today's episode is titled "Sparkle, My Heart! The Power of Song!"

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.650
Does that mean she'll...

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.510
...make an appearance?

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.860
She's our idol!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:46.100
What's really important?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:52.150
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:59.410
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:10.750
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.470
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:19.840
They're all precious things.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.010
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.540
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.600
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.030
you're not alone.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.190
We'll always be together.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.830
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.860
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.040
Open Heart, now!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.700
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:49.710
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:55.550
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.770
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:04.480
Yay, yay, yippee, hooray!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.290
Awesome!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.480
Yay, yay, yippee, hoor-

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.230
Look!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:18.360
Utau-chan's having a concert tomorrow, and Amu-senpai said she'd take me with her!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.230
Oh boy, I can't wait!

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:23.460
I'm so totally her number one fan! Watching her perform live will be a dream come true!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.940
I'm not gonna sleep a wink tonight!

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:29.940
Utau-chan'll be singing right there in front of me on that stage and then maybe our eyes'll meet and ahh!

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:39.210
Line Ends Here

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.960
03 - Sparkle, My Heart! The Power of Song!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.960
Holy! What a huge crowd!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.200
Amu-senpai? Where are you going?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.720
Trust me!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:48.930
Come in.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.760
Hello! Long time no see!

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.760
Yo!

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.360
Good to see you again, Amu.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.110
You, too. Thanks for inviting me.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.510
I-I-Is th-th-that th-the real Utau-san?

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.240
Of course.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.700
Who's the kid?

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:10.830
M-Me?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:16.910
I-I'm S-S-S-ei-yo Academy Elementary's Hi-Hi-i-i-ragi R-Ri-kka!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.070
Let me translate: she's Hiiragi Rikka-chan.

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.510
She's currently a Guardian Apprentice.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.680
N-Nice to meet you.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:26.680
Likewise.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.520
Amu-senpai, are you and Utau-san friends?

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.980
Well, a lot of things happened.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.750
It's quite a long story.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:38.910
Got that right.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.030
But they get along great now!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:45.200
Our friendship has nothing to do with her being famous, though.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:49.660
Wowsers! Amu-senpai is just so totally awesome!

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:01.890
Um, I really love your songs, Utau-san.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.840
Whenever I listen to them, I feel re-energized!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.510
Good luck tonight!

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:12.560
Thank you.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.430
I hope you enjoy it.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.740
Wow, it's a full house!

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:24.530
It was rough for a while after we left Easter.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.900
We handed out a ton of fliers!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.590
They've been like this a lot lately.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.950
Il and El are just happy for you.

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.430
I wish...

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.290
Ikuto could've come tonight.

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.930
Yoru sent this picture to us.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.190
I got one, too!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:14:00.360
Ikuto is traveling the world to find our father.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:04.110
But no matter where he is, I feel him watching over us.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.820
Yeah, I'm sure that's true.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.420
See you later.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.960
Good luck, Utau!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.840
Good luck!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:22.520
How can you feel energized by a song?

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.130
Music does not aid in recovering from fatigue.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:29.970
It's about feelings. Like being moved.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:33.390
Hasn't your heart ever been stirred by music?

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:36.700
Music is nothing but an arrangement of sounds.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.740
And sounds are vibrations in the atmosphere.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:39.730
They hold no inherent meaning.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:41.400
That's not true!

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.900
Utau-chan's songs are really amazing!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:50.100
Once you actually hear her sing, I'm sure you'll understand.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.260
I'm not kidding!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.030
Should we get going?

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:56.910
Yeah!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.970
Hey! Did you come from my house?!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.140
Pardon?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:09.800
Your house?

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.360
Um, I just need to go to the bathroom!

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.600
No, wait! I, uh, forgot something at home!

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:16.980
Hold on, Rikka!

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.910
You followed me, didn't you?

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.400
Why?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.780
You love Utau-chan's songs?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.130
But I told you...

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.350
An X Egg?

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.800
Um!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.120
Wouldn't it be better to let Amu handle it?

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.210
Probably... But there are some <i>issues</i>...

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.650
Like what?

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:50.190
I get the feeling this little one isn't bad.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:53.430
I figured I'd try talking to it first...

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.850
An X Egg that's not bad?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.920
Even if you feel you're being crushed by sadness,

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:20.410
please don't make that face.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:27.750
Just throw away that cheap pride you wear!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.890
Amu-chan, an X Egg's nearby!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.330
This way!

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.600
Hey!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.080
Miki!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.390
You got it!

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:49.320
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.750
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.150
Amu-senpai!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:13.220
Stand back, you two!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:23.320
Prism Music!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:31.070
Wait, dangit! Come here!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.040
Give up. You can't help.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.860
Just let Amu take care of it.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.520
I don't care if it's impossible! I'm still gonna try!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.370
Rikka, what is it saying?

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:44.580
She gave up her dream of being a singer after she failed an audition.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.220
Everyone makes mistakes!

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.390
I mistook soy sauce for barbecue sauce once!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:51.920
I ate the pudding my dad had in the fridge!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.100
I think she's got kind of...

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.510
And I keep losing my left socks!

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.700
...the wrong idea.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.180
So you can't just give up!

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.430
Please reconsider!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.640
You lose one audition, and this is how you react?!

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.230
Can't you hear that song?

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:24.700
Utau's struggled a lot to get where she is!

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:30.160
There were times when she couldn't perform or release new songs...

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:33.590
But she never gave up!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.070
Listen!

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.380
Let it reach you!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:47.220
Show me your wonderful smile, bright as the sun!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.810
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.650
Open Heart!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.520
Glorious sunshine!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:07.980
There's an unwavering light piercing your heart.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:12.300
You, and only you, can find the true meaning of that radiance.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:23.130
Sing a song of thanks, bright as the sun!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:27.980
A certain girl told me something earlier.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.900
"When I listen to your songs, they re-energize me."

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:36.940
But that's just as true for me!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.070
As long as you're all here to cheer me on...

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:46.790
I'll keep singing, no matter what!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.760
Utau-chan!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.170
What's that?

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:11.720
They must be here to pick Hikaru-kun up.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:14.190
He is the President of Easter, after all!

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:20.940
That was interesting.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:21.930
Really?

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:23.040
Didn't I tell you?

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:26.050
Aren't Utau-chan's songs just the best?

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:30.610
No. It was most fascinating to see you so enthralled.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:31.910
Me?

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:39.130
Amu is similar, but I've never had someone in my life quite like you before.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:42.730
I intend to take this opportunity to observe you quite thoroughly.

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.400
Observe?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.400
I will see you again at school.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.070
Wait right there!

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.140
What do you mean, I'm fascinating?!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.760
Turn that car around!

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:57.010
Come back here!

00:20:57.010 --> 00:21:00.020
I said come back!

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.880
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:07.640
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.470
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.940
First, for those who chose Miki:

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:22.070
You get four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.610
Super Lucky!

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:26.070
You'll be able to concentrate so well it'll shock you!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:28.590
Expect good things on that next test!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.290
Su's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.770
You can study at your own pace without any interruptions.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:34.070
If you want to study, the libary's lucky!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.990
Ran's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:39.110
Give a group study date a try!

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:39.500
You'll make good progress if you study with your friends.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.370
Finally, for those who chose Dia's egg:

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.290
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.990
You won't be able to focus on your studies.

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.990
No matter what you try, you'll have trouble remembering things.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.970
Your lucky item is a swing!

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:53.950
Take a short break and do something different to help yourself refocus.

00:21:55.470 --> 00:22:00.180
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:08.220
The auditions started on the official Nakayoshi magazine homepage in September!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:14.730
All of you who want to become a member of Shugo Chara Egg!, we're calling you! Yes, you!

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:18.230
Thanks to everyone who applied!

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:20.230
Here's who is eligible to try out!

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:32.330
Audition Requirements:

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:32.330
Girls from first grade elementary to third year middle school.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:32.330
Able to commute to lessons in Tokyo.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:32.330
No contracts with other talent agencies or record companies.

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:25.620
For more details, see the program's website, or the latest issue of Nakayoshi!

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:28.700
The deadline to apply is October 19th!

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.050
We can't wait to see all your auditions!

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:34.660
Hooray!

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:37.110
I wonder what kind of girl will become our Dia?

00:22:37.110 --> 00:22:38.350
I can't wait to find out!

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.170
Don't drag your feet, just try out!

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:43.690
See you next week for another episode of Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:47.290
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:48.770
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
